Subject: [PATCH 2/2] kosmickrisp: execute Vulkan geometry shaders on Metal

Lower the vertex-producing and geometry stages to GPU compute. Rasterize
the captured points, lines or triangles in Vulkan emission order. Capture
executes each application invocation once, including storage side effects
when it emits no geometry. Keep direct-draw scratch local to the command
buffer and reuse indirect scratch after each draw. Indirect draws share
the upstream 128 MiB GPU heap with tessellation and primitive restart.
A single draw exceeding the remaining capacity can lose the device.

Apply after 0001 so the final raster stage can also use polygon point mode.

